  <p><b>Why this TRI:</b> ${esc(r.why||"Complete the review: "+r.rated+" of 26 criteria rated, "+r.uncited+" uncited; evidence answers "+(r.weakestEQ==null?"incomplete":"complete")+"; jurisdiction "+(r.jci.level||"incomplete")+".")}</p>
